# Routine ripgrep searches focus on current source, tests and guides.
# Search history explicitly: rg --no-ignore "pattern" archive checkpoints workflows/experiments
# Search recorded outcomes: rg "pattern" docs/generated/EVIDENCE-INDEX.md
# These rules affect search only; Git tracking, imports and evidence checks are unchanged.
/archive/
/checkpoints/
/workflows/experiments/
/docs/generated/
/docs/*20[0-9][0-9]*.md
